    "en": "So on August 24th, Getúlio made a decision, he was in his room at the Government Palace, when he took a revolver and shot himself in the chest, leaving a letter saying that he was leaving his life to go down in history. I fear calmly, I take the first step on the path to eternity and I leave life to enter history after Getúlio Brazil gained one populist president after another each in his own way and the result of this is that after 10 years Brazil became chaos the first of them was a guy called Jucelino Kubichek the opposition tried to prevent Jucelino from taking office but the army guaranteed his inauguration which became known by the slogan 50 years in five he invested completely in the development of Brazil and continued with the idea of industrialization.",
